# Reading + Writing engines: fast reuse across units

When the user asks to add Reading/Writing tasks for another unit, reuse the existing CPE patterns immediately, without re-explaining architecture.

## Reading engine baseline

- Keep the same training shell: passage + MCQ + check/reset.
- Include interactive **Evidence vs Distractor Hunt** with brush modes, per-question tabs, check/clear, and short explanations.
- Use phrase-level chunks (not isolated words) for hunt fragments and feedback.

## Writing engine baseline

- Keep the same bundle: useful-language panel, categorized writing bank, paraphrase game, model-answer reference tracker.
- Keep mini writing checker with actionable feedback and CPE-style examiner profile:
  - Content
  - Communicative Achievement
  - Organisation
  - Language
- Support strict phrase mission when requested (track used/missing required phrases).

## Delivery style for this maintainer

- Default to rapid implementation-first rollout for new units.
- Keep chat replies short and practical; avoid long explanations unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve CPE/FCE/EGE separation rules while reusing mechanics.
